flowchart TB
  subgraph http [HTTP API Lambda]
    API[API Gateway] --> WAH[withApiHandler]
    WAH --> APIPipe[buildApiExecutionPipeline]
    APIPipe --> Handler[Your handler]
  end

  subgraph async [Event consumer Lambda]
    EB[SQS / EventBridge / Stream] --> OE[onEvent / onQueue / onDynamoEvent]
    OE --> EventPipe[buildEventExecutionPipeline]
    EventPipe --> CE[consumeEvent]
    CE --> Biz[Registry handler per eventType]
  end

  subgraph obs [All Lambdas]
    LOG[observability: logger + correlationId]
    TR[tracer + performance metrics]
  end

  APIPipe --> obs
  EventPipe --> obs